{"unit_id":"HONYUZHE__dsh-screen-flow#card-zh","repo":"HONYUZHE/dsh-screen-flow","commit":"82ed3d2e1f91e34b55ea42295ae2c6f94bc6e630","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-screen-flow**（DSH 插件，Web profile）：为 Android 界面自动化提供条件等待和声明式步骤流。它向 DSH 注册 `screen_wait` 与 `screen_flow` 两个工具，通过 DSHA 本机桥读取无障碍界面并执行操作。可等待文字出现或消失、等待画面稳定，也可按序启动应用、点击、输入、按系统键、滑动和检查文字；步骤失败时返回执行轨迹与当时屏幕，连续流程可合并为一次调用。适合用 DSH 自动完成手机应用中的多步界面任务；需要运行中的 DSHA Android 应用及已启用的屏幕操作能力。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:174-190","lib/index.js:262-284","lib/flow.js:18-30","lib/flow.js:242-328","lib/bridge.js:184-221"]}
{"unit_id":"HONYUZHE__dsh-screen-flow#card-en","repo":"HONYUZHE/dsh-screen-flow","commit":"82ed3d2e1f91e34b55ea42295ae2c6f94bc6e630","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-screen-flow is a DSH plugin for Android automation. It adds `screen_wait` for screen text or stability and `screen_flow` to sequence waits, taps, typing, and other actions in one call. Failures include a trace and current screen. Requires DSHA Android with screen operation enabled.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:174-190","lib/index.js:262-284","lib/flow.js:18-30","lib/flow.js:242-328","lib/bridge.js:184-221"]}
