{"unit_id":"HONYUZHE__dsh-screen-flow#feature-condition-wait","repo":"HONYUZHE/dsh-screen-flow","commit":"82ed3d2e1f91e34b55ea42295ae2c6f94bc6e630","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-screen-flow** 的功能「条件等待」：等待 Android 屏幕上的文字出现或消失，也可叠加等待画面稳定；调用 `screen_wait` 后返回条件状态和当前界面内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:174-190","lib/index.js:207-245"]}
{"unit_id":"HONYUZHE__dsh-screen-flow#feature-step-flow","repo":"HONYUZHE/dsh-screen-flow","commit":"82ed3d2e1f91e34b55ea42295ae2c6f94bc6e630","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-screen-flow** 的功能「多步界面流程」：调用 `screen_flow` 按顺序执行多个步骤，把等待、检查、点击、输入、系统按键、滑动或启动应用组合在一条流程中，并返回步骤轨迹。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:262-284","lib/flow.js:18-30","lib/flow.js:242-328"]}
{"unit_id":"HONYUZHE__dsh-screen-flow#feature-tap-fallback","repo":"HONYUZHE/dsh-screen-flow","commit":"82ed3d2e1f91e34b55ea42295ae2c6f94bc6e630","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-screen-flow** 的功能「文字或坐标点击」：流程的 `tap` 步骤可用屏幕文字或坐标定位；文字点击失败时会查找匹配的可点击元素，再尝试按坐标点击。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/flow.js:95-127"]}
{"unit_id":"HONYUZHE__dsh-screen-flow#feature-failure-trace","repo":"HONYUZHE/dsh-screen-flow","commit":"82ed3d2e1f91e34b55ea42295ae2c6f94bc6e630","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-screen-flow** 的功能「失败定位与可选步骤」：流程失败时记录失败步骤和当时屏幕；标记为 `optional` 的失败步骤会继续执行后续步骤。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/flow.js:38-49","lib/flow.js:291-328"]}
{"unit_id":"HONYUZHE__dsh-screen-flow#feature-screen-delta","repo":"HONYUZHE/dsh-screen-flow","commit":"82ed3d2e1f91e34b55ea42295ae2c6f94bc6e630","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-screen-flow** 的功能「屏幕变化摘要」：成功流程会对比开始与结束的无障碍树，并返回新增、移除或移动的界面元素摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:297-323","lib/screen.js:195-251"]}
{"unit_id":"HONYUZHE__dsh-screen-flow#caveat-dsha","repo":"HONYUZHE/dsh-screen-flow","commit":"82ed3d2e1f91e34b55ea42295ae2c6f94bc6e630","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-screen-flow 依赖运行中的 DSHA Android 应用及其屏幕操作能力，并通过本机桥地址读取界面和发送操作；桥默认使用 127.0.0.1:3090，可由 DSHA_BRIDGE_BASE 覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/bridge.js:22-25","lib/bridge.js:132-146","lib/index.js:161-163"]}
